checks/audits/fuel-reserves--2026-10-02-g7-releases-100-million-barrels-2026-10-03-r8c-editor.md:28:For the seven answers, in order: **1 leave** the basic act, but complete the package in the story view; **2 act** by joining the price to the people and purpose; **3 act** by making the three competing claims one shorter correction; **4 leave** the crude-versus-diesel sentence; **5 act** on the dispersed sequence; **6 leave** the explicit unknowns; **7 leave** the report and bid dates, while keeping them distinct from completed action.
